{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Rotation assistance: target aura conditions accept another caster",
  "contract": [
    "The imported playerbots target-has-aura trigger calls HasAura with checkIsOwner=false.",
    "A Starcaller in specialization 45 must recognize Scattered Stars 804378 from another caster and",
    "prefer Lunar Lance 801132 over the generic fallback. Fire Blast rank 2 (2137, SpellLevel 14) precedes",
    "Lunar Lance (SpellLevel 1) in the fallback, so it distinguishes the two selection paths.",
    "A second Starcaller applies Scattered Stars as a fixture. This tests condition ownership, not shared",
    "resource consumption, spell acquisition or an optimized Starcaller rotation. Higher-priority abilities",
    "are unlearned as fixtures and the target is outside melee range. CoA.RotationAssist.Enable must be 1."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
